  <div><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;"><b><a id="finstate" title="finstate" href="#"></a>ITEM&#160;8. FINANCIAL STATEMENTS AND SUPPLEMENTARY DATA</b></p>
