  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:center;">The accompanying notes form an integral part of these Consolidated Financial Statements.</p>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;">&#160;</p>
  <div class="PGBK" style="width: 100%; margin-left: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt">
