<tr style="vertical-align: bottom; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"> <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 18pt;">Total intangible assets related to discontinued operations</p> </td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt; border-bottom: 3px double rgb(0, 0, 0);">$</td><td style="width: 12%; text-align: right; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt; border-bottom: 3px double rgb(0, 0, 0);"><ix:nonFraction id="c142569785" contextRef="i_2024-12-29_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis-SegmentDiscontinuedOperationsMember_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis-SensiMLMember" unitRef="USD" name="quik:DisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperationIntangibleAssetsGross" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">1,156</ix:nonFraction></td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; padding-bottom: 3px; margin-left: 0pt;">&#160;</td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt; border-bottom: 3px double rgb(0, 0, 0);">$</td><td style="width: 12%; text-align: right; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt; border-bottom: 3px double rgb(0, 0, 0);">(<ix:nonFraction id="c142569786" contextRef="i_2024-12-29_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis-SegmentDiscontinuedOperationsMember_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis-SensiMLMember" unitRef="USD" name="quik:DisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperationIntangibleAssetsAccumulatedAmortization" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">726</ix:nonFraction></td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt; padding-bottom: 3px;">)</td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt; border-bottom: 3px double rgb(0, 0, 0);">$</td><td style="width: 12%; text-align: right; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt; border-bottom: 3px double rgb(0, 0, 0);"><ix:nonFraction id="c142569787" contextRef="i_2024-12-29_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis-SegmentDiscontinuedOperationsMember_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis-SensiMLMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:DisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperationIntangibleAssets" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-4">430</ix:nonFraction></td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; padding-bottom: 3px; margin-left: 0pt;">&#160;</td></tr>
</tbody></table>
   </ix:continuation>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 45pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -2pt; text-indent: 45pt;">The Company recorded depreciation and amortization expense for discontinued operations of $<ix:nonFraction id="c142570697" contextRef="d_2024-12-30_2025-12-28_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis-SegmentDiscontinuedOperationsMember_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis-SensiMLMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:DisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperationDepreciationAndAmortization" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">0.0</ix:nonFraction> million&#160;and&#160;$<ix:nonFraction id="c142570698" contextRef="d_2024-01-01_2024-12-29_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis-SegmentDiscontinuedOperationsMember_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis-SensiMLMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:DisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperationDepreciationAndAmortization" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-5">0.8</ix:nonFraction> million&#160;for the Fiscal Years&#160;ended <em style="font: inherit;"> December 28, 2025</em>&#160;and&#160;<em style="font: inherit;"> December 29, 2024</em>, respectively. <em style="font: inherit;">No</em> interest was capitalized for any period presented. As of <em style="font: inherit;"> January 7, 2025, </em>depreciation and amortization of assets held by SensiML was discontinued in accordance with ASC <em style="font: inherit;">205.</em></p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 16pt; text-indent: 27pt;">Depreciation and amortization expense for&#160;the Fiscal Years&#160;ended <em style="font: inherit;"> December 28, 2025</em>&#160;and&#160;<em style="font: inherit;"> December 29, 2024</em>&#160;included approximately $<ix:nonFraction id="c142570701" contextRef="d_2024-12-30_2025-12-28_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis-SegmentDiscontinuedOperationsMember_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis-SensiMLMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:CapitalizedComputerSoftwareAmortization1" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">0</ix:nonFraction>&#160;and&#160;$<ix:nonFraction id="c142570702" contextRef="d_2024-01-01_2024-12-29_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis-SegmentDiscontinuedOperationsMember_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis-SensiMLMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:CapitalizedComputerSoftwareAmortization1" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-5">0.7</ix:nonFraction> million, respectively, of amortization expense related to capitalized internal-use software.</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -2pt; text-indent: 45pt;">For its trades receivable, the Company provides an allowance for credit losses based on historical experience and a specific identification basis. As of <em style="font: inherit;"> December 28, 2025</em>, <em style="font: inherit;"> December 29, 2024</em>, and <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2023</em>, the allowance for credit losses from discontinued operations was&#160;$<ix:nonFraction id="c142570703" contextRef="i_2025-12-28_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis-SegmentDiscontinuedOperationsMember_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis-SensiMLMember" unitRef="USD" name="quik:DisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperationAccountsAllowanceForCreditLosses" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">0</ix:nonFraction> thousand, $<ix:nonFraction id="c142570704" contextRef="i_2024-12-29_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis-SegmentDiscontinuedOperationsMember_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis-SensiMLMember" unitRef="USD" name="quik:DisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperationAccountsAllowanceForCreditLosses" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-4">30</ix:nonFraction> thousand, and $<ix:nonFraction id="c142570705" contextRef="i_2023-12-31_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis-SegmentDiscontinuedOperationsMember_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis-SensiMLMember" unitRef="USD" name="quik:DisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperationAccountsAllowanceForCreditLosses" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">34</ix:nonFraction> thousand, respectively. The Company recorded&#160;credit loss expense in discontinued operations of $<ix:nonFraction id="c142570706" contextRef="i_2025-12-28_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis-SegmentDiscontinuedOperationsMember_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis-SensiMLMember" unitRef="USD" name="quik:DisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperationAccountsCreditLossExpense" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">7</ix:nonFraction> thousand&#160;and&#160;$<ix:nonFraction id="c142570707" contextRef="i_2024-12-29_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis-SegmentDiscontinuedOperationsMember_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis-SensiMLMember" unitRef="USD" name="quik:DisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperationAccountsCreditLossExpense" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">6</ix:nonFraction> thousand&#160;for the Fiscal Years&#160;ended <em style="font: inherit;"> December 28, 2025</em>&#160;and&#160;<em style="font: inherit;"> December 29, 2024</em>, respectively.&#160;Accounts receivable related to discontinued operations, net of allowances for credit losses, was $<ix:nonFraction id="c142570708" contextRef="i_2023-12-31_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis-SegmentDiscontinuedOperationsMember_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis-SensiMLMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:DisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperationAccountsNotesAndLoansReceivableNet" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">2</ix:nonFraction> thousand&#160;as of <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2023</em>.</p>
   <p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -2pt; text-indent: 45pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -2pt; text-indent: 45pt;">The following table provides&#160;details relating to major line items constituting income (loss) for the SensiML group, classified as discontinued operations,&#160;for the Fiscal Years ended&#160;<em style="font: inherit;"> December 28, 2025</em>&#160;and&#160;<em style="font: inherit;"> December 29, 2024</em>&#160;(in thousands):</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 45pt;">&#160;</p>
   <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2024-12-30_2025-12-28" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsIncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresTextBlock" id="c94BEA75B-8488-4A1F-8082-969FB2DF2F18" escape="true" continuedAt="CE15BA46-786C-4C76-9F33-02004031AF06">
