<tr style="vertical-align: bottom; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"> <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;">Total</p> </td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt; border-bottom: 3px double rgb(0, 0, 0);">$</td><td style="width: 12%; text-align: right; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt; border-bottom: 3px double rgb(0, 0, 0);">(<ix:nonFraction id="c142569854" contextRef="d_2024-12-30_2025-12-28_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis-SegmentDiscontinuedOperationsMember_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis-SensiMLMember" unitRef="USD" name="quik:DisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperationSharebasedPaymentArrangementExpense" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3" sign="-">32</ix:nonFraction></td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt; padding-bottom: 3px;">)</td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt; border-bottom: 3px double rgb(0, 0, 0);">$</td><td style="width: 12%; text-align: right; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt; border-bottom: 3px double rgb(0, 0, 0);"><ix:nonFraction id="c142569855" contextRef="d_2024-01-01_2024-12-29_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis-SegmentDiscontinuedOperationsMember_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis-SensiMLMember" unitRef="USD" name="quik:DisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperationSharebasedPaymentArrangementExpense" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">107</ix:nonFraction></td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; padding-bottom: 3px; margin-left: 0pt;">&#160;</td></tr>
</tbody></table>
   </ix:continuation>
   <p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -1pt; text-indent: 45pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -1pt; text-indent: 45pt;">The Company grants restricted stock units (&#8220;RSUs&#8221;) and performance restricted stock units ("PRSUs") to employees and directors with various vesting terms. RSUs entitle the holder to receive, at&#160;<em style="font: inherit;">no</em>&#160;cost,&#160;<em style="font: inherit;">one</em>&#160;common share for each RSU as it vests. In general, the Company's policy is to withhold shares in settlement of employee tax withholding obligations upon the vesting of RSUs. The stock-based compensation expense related to RSUs and PRSUs from discontinued operations was approximately&#160;($<ix:nonFraction id="c142570721" contextRef="d_2024-12-30_2025-12-28_AwardTypeAxis-RSUsAndPRSUsMember_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis-SegmentDiscontinuedOperationsMember_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis-SensiMLMember" unitRef="USD" name="quik:DisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperationSharebasedPaymentArrangementExpense" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3" sign="-">32</ix:nonFraction> thousand)&#160;and&#160;$<ix:nonFraction id="c142570722" contextRef="d_2024-01-01_2024-12-29_AwardTypeAxis-RSUsAndPRSUsMember_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis-SegmentDiscontinuedOperationsMember_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis-SensiMLMember" unitRef="USD" name="quik:DisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperationSharebasedPaymentArrangementExpense" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">105</ix:nonFraction> thousand&#160;for the Fiscal Years&#160;ended <em style="font: inherit;"> December 28, 2025</em>&#160;and&#160;<em style="font: inherit;"> December 29, 2024</em>, respectively.</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 8pt; text-indent: 36pt;">Total stock-based compensation in discontinued operations related to the Company's Employee Stock Purchase Plan was approximately $<ix:nonFraction id="c142570723" contextRef="d_2024-12-30_2025-12-28_AwardTypeAxis-EmployeeStockOptionMember_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis-SegmentDiscontinuedOperationsMember_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis-SensiMLMember" unitRef="USD" name="quik:DisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperationSharebasedPaymentArrangementExpense" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">0</ix:nonFraction> thousand&#160;and&#160;$<ix:nonFraction id="c142570724" contextRef="d_2024-01-01_2024-12-29_AwardTypeAxis-EmployeeStockOptionMember_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis-SegmentDiscontinuedOperationsMember_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis-SensiMLMember" unitRef="USD" name="quik:DisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperationSharebasedPaymentArrangementExpense" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">2</ix:nonFraction> thousand&#160;for the Fiscal Years&#160;ended <em style="font: inherit;"> December 28, 2025</em>&#160;and&#160;<em style="font: inherit;"> December 29, 2024</em>, respectively.</p>
   <p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -1pt; text-indent: 45pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -1pt; text-indent: 45pt;">The following table provides cash flows from discontinued operations for the Fiscal Years ended&#160;<em style="font: inherit;"> December 28, 2025</em>&#160;and&#160;<em style="font: inherit;"> December 29, 2024</em>&#160;(in thousands):</p>
   <p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -1pt; text-indent: 45pt;">&#160;</p>
