   </ix:exclude>
   <ix:exclude>&#160;</ix:exclude>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 45pt;"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">Approximately <ix:nonFraction id="c142570730" contextRef="d_2024-12-30_2025-12-28" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:AntidilutiveSecuritiesExcludedFromComputationOfEarningsPerShareAmount" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-5">0.8</ix:nonFraction> million&#160;and&#160;<ix:nonFraction id="c142570731" contextRef="d_2024-01-01_2024-12-29" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:AntidilutiveSecuritiesExcludedFromComputationOfEarningsPerShareAmount" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-5">0.7</ix:nonFraction> million&#160;shares associated with equity awards and the estimated number of shares to be purchased under the current offering period of the ESPP Plan were outstanding and were <em style="font: inherit;">not</em> included in the calculation of diluted net loss per share, as they were considered anti-dilutive due to the net loss the Company experienced in the Fiscal Years ended&#160;</span><em style="font: inherit;"> December 28, 2025</em><span style="background-color:#ffffff">&#160;and&#160;</span><em style="font: inherit;"> December 29, 2024</em><span style="background-color:#ffffff">, respectively. </span></p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 38pt;">&#160;</p>
  </ix:nonNumeric>
  <div>
   &#160;
  </div>
  <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2024-12-30_2025-12-28" name="us-gaap:SupplementalBalanceSheetDisclosuresTextBlock" id="c3148300" escape="true">
