   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0pt;margin-right:109.8%;margin-top:0pt;text-align:left;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: left; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 45pt;">New products revenue consists of revenues from the sale of hardware products&#160;manufactured on&#160;<em style="font: inherit;">180</em>&#160;nanometer or smaller semiconductor processes and of&#160;eFPGA IP licenses, as well as&#160;professional services. Mature products include all products produced on semiconductor processes larger than&#160;<em style="font: inherit;">180</em>&#160;nanometer. Associated royalty revenues are included within their respective device's classification.</p>
   <p style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; margin: 0pt;">&#160;</p>
